{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">(formerly known as 'Urban Warriors')</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Have you ever wanted to make your own arena fighter?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">That\u2019s the heart of Fighters Forge\u2014a vision-driven platform where players can engage in fast-paced 3D battles and help shape the future of fighter creation. We\u2019re building a space not just to fight, but to forge your ideal combat experience. Inspired by tools like Mugen, the classic Fighter Maker, and modern successors like Smack Studio, Fighters Forge aims to be the first arena fighter creation engine\u2014a system for crafting, combining, and customizing fighters in a fully 3D battlefield. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">What\u2019s Playable Now</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Core Combat System:</strong> Team battles and free-for-alls with working 3D rules of engagement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Foundational Movesets:</strong> Every fighter follows a base set of mechanics that establish clarity and balance. - <strong>8 Fighting Styles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dynamic Character Select Screen:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Allowing players to mix-and-match their fighter's avatar, costume, fighting-style, &amp; elemental superpower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853810/extras/ffa29_characterselect.png?t=1747522687\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fighting style determines normal attacks and two special moves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Element determines two special moves &amp; the ultra attack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Toggle Player/CPU/Off for each fighter. Also select team color to determine FFA, 2v2, 1v3, etc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Coop Arcade / Beat'em Up Mode (inspired by Fighting Force &amp; Dynamite Cop) - 5 Stages</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853810/extras/ffa29_levels_coop.png?t=1747522687\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Versus Mode\u00a0(inspired by Power Stone 2 &amp; Marvel Nemesis) - 5 Stages</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853810/extras/ffa29_levels_vs.png?t=1747522687\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Controls<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853810/extras/ffa29_controls.png?t=1747522687\" /></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Current Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4 Player Local Multiplayer (Online Support via Steam Remote Play Together)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Melee Combos with Launchers, Air Juggles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Light attack chains. Heavy attacks are chargeable.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Parry &amp; Parry Reversal Mechanic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grabs, including Techs &amp; Breaks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Weapons/Items </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tossing &amp; Catching Props </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Environmental Destruction</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bursts, Trigger Mode &amp; Ultra attacks</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Current Weapons/Items</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pistol (Golden, Revolver Variations) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sword (Pipe, Crowbar Variations) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Baseball Bat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rocket Launcher  </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Mod Support</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Detailed instructions to be provided soon in the Chaotix Discord server.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">ReadyPlayerMe custom avatars currently supported. The character model can either be loaded from the internet or locally if downloaded.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853810/extras/ffa29_rpm1.png?t=1747522687\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853810/extras/ffa29_rpm2.png?t=1747522687\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Custom FBX character models are also supported and must be rigged to a Mixamo skeleton in an A-Pose.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2853810?t=1747522687","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853810/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747522687","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853810/02d7bd05d9dd66843546d9bd96315803066d2f02/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747522687","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853810/02d7bd05d9dd66843546d9bd96315803066d2f02/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747522687","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">(formerly known as 'Urban Warriors')</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Have you ever wanted to make your own arena fighter?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">That\u2019s the heart of Fighters Forge\u2014a vision-driven platform where players can engage in fast-paced 3D battles and help shape the future of fighter creation. We\u2019re building a space not just to fight, but to forge your ideal comb